Package: radio-website
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Stefan Arentz <stefan.arentz@gmail.com>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: lighttpd, php-fpm, php-cli
Description: Web UI for the Radio daemon
 Lists the SomaFM channels and controls radiod through its loopback HTTP
 API. Served by lighttpd + php-fpm on port 80; the browser never talks to
 the daemon directly.
